{"version":1,"content":"<p>新加坡與沙特阿美達成協議，旨在應對中東戰爭造成的能源供應中斷，保障東南亞能源供應安全。為應對中東戰爭引發的全球能源供應中斷，新加坡將從明年開始，在地下巖洞中儲存來自沙特阿拉伯的石油。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583918.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:00.771119+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:06:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:18:06.869616+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:18:06.869616+00:00","content_hash":"2ecc22b7fe63acccb300a9f745893d64f660aa210c9464343d7fd9729f3f9b96","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}